  "id": "person-centered-planning",
  "term": "person-centered planning",
  "definition": "Person-centered planning is an approach used to explore people’s views and build shared understanding around what support is needed. In this context, it helped pupils, parents, and practitioners work together to identify and organize activities that support children’s transition into primary school.",
